{"n": 1055, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1055.webp", "text": "i /\n\n52-3\n\n§2 20000 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\n\nREAR SEAT CUSHION AND\nBACKREST\n\nLift out seat cushion.\n\nUnscrew bolts (1), or (1a) for convert-\nIbles, and pull up backrest out of\nholders (2).\n\nBMW Touring:.\n\nSplit Rear Seat Cushion and Backrest:\nLift rear end of seat cushion on strap\nand tilt the cushion forward.\n\nPush In both retainers and lift out both\nseal cushions separately.\n\nNote:\n\nReplacing Seat Cushion Covers:\nMount zipper with Special Tool\n\n00 5 020.\n\nAllgn the marks on the zipper to be\nopposite each other prior to Installa-\ntlons.\n\nRemoving Backrest:\n\nTit the side backrest section forward\nfor this purpose.\n\nUnscrew bolt (1).\n\nLift out side backrest section.\n\nTilt backrest forward.\nPush In retainers with a screwdriver.\nLittout backrest from the side.\n\n52 20254 REPLACING LOCK FOR\nLEFT OR RIGHT REAR\nSEAT BACKREST\n\nSlide off cover toward the rear.\nInstallation:\n\nInstall the backrest first and then the\ncover.\n\nPry off the backrest! plate.\n\nUnscrew lock bolts.\nDisconnect linkage.\nRemove backrest lock.", "words": [["i", 0.0399, 0.8724, 0.1941, 0.9709], ["/", 0.2154, 0.9563, 0.2224, 0.9775], ["52-3", 0.4641, 0.0324, 0.5197, 0.0575], ["§2", 0.2735, 0.0761, 0.2856, 0.0866], ["20000", 0.2897, 0.0747, 0.3241, 0.0866], ["REMOVING", 0.3322, 0.0734, 0.3918, 0.0866], ["AND", 0.3959, 0.0747, 0.4196, 0.0853], ["INSTALLING", 0.4237, 0.0734, 0.4904, 0.0853], ["REAR", 0.3322, 0.0906, 0.3625, 0.1032], ["SEAT", 0.3665, 0.088, 0.3969, 0.1032], ["CUSHION", 0.3999, 0.0906, 0.451, 0.1032], ["AND", 0.456, 0.0906, 0.4793, 0.1019], ["BACKREST", 0.3322, 0.1071, 0.3938, 0.1204], ["Lift", 0.2745, 0.1415, 0.2907, 0.1534], ["out", 0.2947, 0.1429, 0.3119, 0.1534], ["seat", 0.316, 0.1429, 0.3382, 0.1534], ["cushion.", 0.3423, 0.1415, 0.3878, 0.1534], ["Unscrew", 0.2745, 0.1587, 0.321, 0.1693], ["bolts", 0.3251, 0.1574, 0.3514, 0.1693], ["(1),", 0.3544, 0.1574, 0.3716, 0.172